  "transcript": "My skills combine development, testing, and application support.\n\nIn software testing, I have experience with manual, functional, regression, unit, and integration testing. I also work with test planning, debugging, requirements, and defect investigation.\n\nMy development work includes C plus plus twenty, C sharp and dot net, Python, and SQL.\n\nThrough my projects, I work with software architecture, web APIs, databases, authentication, and automated testing.\n\nI have used Playwright for browser testing and Git and GitHub for version control.\n\nMy application-support experience includes customer communication, technical documentation, troubleshooting, and Microsoft Dynamics NAV-based finance systems.",
